#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,publisher:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_td1sk_2026
msgid "Canada Revenue Agency"
msgstr "Agence du revenu du Canada"

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_wcbsask_premium_payments
msgid "Employer Premium Payments (POL 25/2025)"
msgstr "Paiement des primes par l'employeur (POL 25/2025)"

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_wcbsask_eps
msgid "Employer's Payroll Statement (EPS)"
msgstr "Déclaration de la masse salariale de l'employeur (EPS)"

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,publisher:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_finance_structure
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,publisher:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_finance_taxes
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,publisher:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_workers_compensation_act
msgid "Government of Saskatchewan"
msgstr "Gouvernement de la Saskatchewan"

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_wcbsask_premium_rates
msgid ""
"Industry premium rates per 100 of assessable payroll, by rate code, adjusted"
" by the Experience Rating Program; the employer enters the rate of its "
"premium rate notice on its provincial payroll account."
msgstr ""
"Taux de prime de l'industrie par tranche de 100 de masse salariale "
"cotisable, par code de taux, ajustés par le programme de tarification par "
"incidence ; l'employeur saisit le taux de son avis de taux de prime dans son"
" compte provincial de paie."

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_finance_taxes
msgid ""
"List of the provincial taxes administered by the Ministry of Finance: "
"corporation capital and income taxes, fuel tax, insurance premiums tax, "
"liquor consumption tax, prorated vehicle tax, PST, tobacco and vapour "
"products taxes. Saskatchewan levies no employer payroll tax: the list has "
"none."
msgstr ""
"Liste des taxes provinciales administrées par le ministère des Finances : "
"impôts sur le capital et sur le revenu des sociétés, taxe sur les "
"carburants, taxe sur les primes d'assurance, taxe sur la consommation "
"d'alcool, taxe proportionnelle sur les véhicules, TVP, taxes sur le tabac et"
" les produits de vapotage. La Saskatchewan ne perçoit aucune taxe sur la "
"masse salariale : la liste n'en contient pas."

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_wcbsask_maximum
msgid "Maximum Assessable Earnings"
msgstr "Gains cotisables maximums"

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_wcbsask_maximum
msgid ""
"Maximum assessable wage rate per worker, set each year under section 137(2) "
"of The Workers' Compensation Act, 2013: 96,945 in 2023, 99,945 in 2024, "
"104,531 in 2025, 108,223 in 2026. No premium on the earnings above it."
msgstr ""
"Salaire cotisable maximum par travailleur, fixé chaque année en vertu du "
"paragraphe 137(2) de The Workers' Compensation Act, 2013 : 96 945 en 2023, "
"99 945 en 2024, 104 531 en 2025, 108 223 en 2026. Aucune prime sur les gains"
" qui le dépassent."

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_wcbsask_personal_coverage
msgid "Optional Personal Coverage"
msgstr "Protection personnelle facultative"

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_wcbsask_premium_rates
msgid "Premium Rates and How They're Set"
msgstr "Taux de prime et leur établissement"

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_wcbsask_personal_coverage
msgid ""
"Proprietors, partners and, since January 1, 2025, directors of a corporation"
" paid on a T4 are not workers: their earnings are not assessable unless they"
" buy optional personal coverage."
msgstr ""
"Les propriétaires, les associés et, depuis le 1er janvier 2025, les "
"administrateurs d'une société rémunérés sur un T4 ne sont pas des "
"travailleurs : leurs gains ne sont pas cotisables, à moins qu'ils n'achètent"
" une protection personnelle facultative."

#. module: l10n_ca_sk_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_sk_payroll.source_finance_taxes
msgid "Provincial Taxes, Policies and Bulletins"
msgstr "Taxes, politiques et bulletins provinciaux"

